ub.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-beets/compare/nightly-a264a76c-ls19...nightly-ad27129f-ls20","upstream":"Fix --from-logfile parsing when semicolons appear in paths (#7185)\n\n### Problem\nFixes #4941.\n\nWhen importing from a log file (`beet import --from-logfile ...`), paths\nrecorded in the log file were split with `paths.split(\"; \")`. If any\npath contained a semicolon in a directory or file name (e.g. `Band;\nThe/Album`), it was split into multiple chunks where subsequent chunks\nwere relative. Passing mixed absolute and relative segments to\n`os.path.commonpath()` raised:\n```\nValueError: Can't mix absolute and relative paths\n```\n\n### Solution\nIn `paths_from_logfile`, when log lines contain absolute paths, merge\nany subsequent non-absolute chunks back into the preceding absolute path\nbefore computing `os.path.commonpath()`.\n\n### Tests\nAdded regression tests covering paths containing semicolons in directory\nnames for both Windows and POSIX path formats.","upstream_url":"https://github.com/beetbox/beets/commit/ad27129f48cb56030734c4a9ddadbfb826d0cbdc"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/config","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","BEETSDIR=/config","EDITOR=nano"],"exposed_ports":["8337/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-ad27129f-ls20.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-ad27129f-ls20/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-ad27129f-ls20/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/beets/builds/nightly-ad27129f-ls20/l